    <h2>Make the location choice before comparing amenities</h2>
    <p>Start with where you expect to spend most of your time. Then compare the hotel’s exact address, beach access, on-site facilities and transport arrangements. The official <a href="https://www.goa.gov.in/what_to_see/beaches/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Government of Goa beaches overview</a> describes the North and South Goa circuits; the <a href="https://goa-tourism.com/siteseeing/beaches-of-north-goa/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Goa Tourism Development Corporation North Goa guide</a> gives area-level beach context. Confirm current access and services with each hotel before booking.
    </p>
    <p>For the broader shortlist, return to the <a href="/">ten Goa hotels</a> or read the <a href="/guides/best-areas-to-stay-in-goa/">guide to choosing an area</a>.</p>
